Weekly Engineering Status Report
Week ending: 2026-01-29

Executive Summary:
Engineering made steady progress this week. The backend migration to PostgreSQL is complete and stable. 
API documentation has been finalized and is available for internal use. The frontend redesign is 80% 
complete; remaining UI refinements and responsive fixes are underway. The internal dashboard has been 
deployed for stakeholder review and feedback is being collected. QA testing for the notification module 
is delayed due to missing test cases; engineering and QA are prioritizing creation of the test cases to 
minimize release impact.

